OL,3,GNEWSAWhat do people in NI want to see
OL,4,Ain the Budget?
OL,5,
OL,6,FStormont ministers are finding out how
OL,7,Fmuch extra money they will have to
OL,8,Fspend as a result of the Westminster
OL,9,FBudget.
OL,11,FMore money could help lead to a deal on
OL,12,Fthe Stormont budget which is still not
OL,13,Fagreed, seven months into the financial
OL,14,Fyear.
OL,16,FChancellor John Healey, who is
OL,17,Fcurrently delivering the budget, is
OL,18,Funlikely to deliver everything the
OL,19,FNorthern Ireland parties say they need.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
